00:06:23.000 --> 00:07:05.000
the outside, indicating the room had been secured from within. Although the balcony door was open, the windows were sealed shut and intact. Greg's wallet, with a stack of $100 bills inside, was still in the room, as was his laptop, ruling out a robbery gone wrong. Detectives spoke to guests in the surrounding rooms, but no one reported hearing shouting, fighting, or anything else unusual coming from room 348. A search of Greg's luggage didn't reveal any prescription medication or anything else that could explain his death, and his colleague said he wasn't a particularly healthy man.

