00:10:24.000 --> 00:11:05.000
Either something had happened inside room 348 that left little to no outward trace, or Greg had been injured elsewhere and somehow ended up back in his room. Neither option sat comfortably with what Detective Apple had witnessed. He went back over the initial response, looking for anything that might have been missed or dismissed too quickly. He couldn't figure out how someone could have possibly sustained that level of internal trauma without clearer signs on the surface. A check of the hotel's security footage showed that Greg arrived at the hotel's hotel alone at around 6.30 p.m., but there was no footage of the hallways.

