00:11:54.000 --> 00:12:49.000
The two had married young before going their separate ways and then reconnecting later in life. When Susie contacted Greg after years apart, he told her that he'd been waiting for her call. They'd remarried and stayed together for the next 15 years. In all that time, Susie knew Greg to be a kind, dependable and quiet-natured man with no enemies. The couple ran a bed and breakfast from their home in Lafayette, and Greg warmly welcomed guests from all over, often serving them fish or meat that he'd caught or hunted himself. As a world traveller, he loved nature more than anything, and never took a good sunset or star-studded sky for granted. Greg also adored animals and relished the quiet moments sitting in his courtyard surrounded by his cats and visiting birds.

