00:12:49.000 --> 00:13:34.000
Greg touched many lives, and others who knew him gave a similar account to Susie's, describing him as well-liked, generous and easy to get along with. He was also a creature of habit, especially when he travelled for work. Susie told detectives that at the end of the day, Greg typically returned to his hotel room and kept to his routine, watching television and unwinding before going to bed. He wasn't a big drinker, making it unlikely that he would have gone down to the hotel bar. This was confirmed by staff and guests at the MCM Eleganté. none of whom had seen Greg outside of his room on the night he died. Police found nothing to suggest Greg had sought out anyone's company

