or done anything out of the ordinary during his time in Beaumont, and by all accounts, he was a devoted and loyal husband to Susie. However, there was one workplace incident that caught their attention. Five days before Greg died, his company had fired one of their employees. The woman's husband, a man named to Judge. Joseph was furious, believing the decision to be unjust, and he called the office demanding to speak with Greg. Detectives looked into Joseph's background and learned he had martial arts experience, which was a possible explanation for the injuries. But Joseph provided an alibi and it checked out,

