00:14:16.000 --> 00:15:00.000
confirming he was nowhere near Beaumont on the night Greg died. Detectives also reviewed Greg's financial records but found nothing to suggest pressure, conflicts or any obvious cause for concern. With no clear motive or suspect emerging, the detectives were dealing with three immediate problems. A victim who was by all accounts much loved, a hotel room that didn't appear like a crime scene, and fatal injuries that made no sense. It's a big mystery, reporter Zach Lajway told the Investigation Discovery Channel. We all just go to bed thinking we're going to wake up in the morning. Nobody's going to do us any harm while we're sleeping.

