injured Greg during some kind of sexually motivated assault, or perhaps the two men knew one another personally and Garcia had some kind of vendetta. They summoned Garcia to the station for a formal interview, where they told him they had evidence placing him in room 348 on the night that Greg Flanagan died. Faced with that information, as well as a photo of Greg, Garcia changed his account. He admitted that he went to Greg's room to reset the breaker, but insisted that Greg was still alive when he left. If Garcia was telling the truth, it meant that Greg was alive after the person.

