and probably wouldn't have heard anything coming from outside. They said they went down to the hotel bar at some point after the power outage and returned to the room around midnight. Upon their return, they thought they might have heard a cough coming from next door, but they couldn't be sure exactly what time. Like others at the hotel, Mueller and Steinmetz were curious to know what had happened to Greg Flanagan. The detective simply told them that Greg's injuries were unusual and that investigators were considering whether some kind of heavy force might have come down on him.

