else came up. For the detectives, the fact that Greg's death had taken place in a busy hotel added an extra layer of difficulty to the already confusing investigation. The elegante was a large and popular venue and guests from all over the country stayed there for all kinds of reasons, be it business or personal. If another guest was responsible for Greg's death or knew anything about it, they could have checked out before his body was even discovered and they would have been long gone before detectives started investigating the case as a homicide. As the months passed with no breakthroughs, the lack of progress became harder and harder for Greg Flaniken's family to accept. In November, after the Beaumont police publicly announced that Greg's death was being treated as a murder,

