his family offered a $50,000 reward for information. Susie told the Beaumont Enterprise that Greg lived an honest and sincere life and had an impact on anybody who got to know him. It's such a difficult situation to have a life of an incredible person shortened in a dishonorable way, Susie said. I don't know much about the investigation, but I do know who Greg was. He was such an incredible person and he had an impact on anybody who got to know him. We're just hoping and praying for information. Somebody knows something. With no leads coming from the reward, Greg's brother hired a private investigator, but that didn't generate any meaningful results either.

