Mueller had responded, I was doing better till now. When the case reached court in Jefferson County in September 2012, 48-year-old Lance Mueller did not deny that the gun had fired. but he disputed the outcome. His position was that the discharge had been accidental and that he didn't know the bullet had struck anyone in the adjoining room. To pursue manslaughter, the prosecutors didn't need to prove intent to kill,

