10 minutes to die from his injuries, the second medical examiner estimated. that Greg could have been alive for hours. The gunshot likely caused him to lurch to his feet and then stagger to the spot where he was later found by his co-workers. It was a painful, silent death, one which Lance Mueller did nothing to help. Immediately after discharging the gun, he concealed the damage in the wall with toothpaste,

