drivers who hit a dog on the side of the road show more compassion than Lance Mueller did for her husband. She thought Greg would have been proud of her for pursuing the truth, remarking, I think Greg would say, good for you, Sue, you stuck with it, you found out who did it, brought them to court, and now, please go and have a happy life. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
